---
import { SITE } from "../config/site";
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title={`Privacy notice | ${SITE.name}`}
  description={`A plain-language overview of the data practices in the current static ${SITE.name} release.`}
  canonicalPath="/privacy/"
>
  <article class="shell text-page legal-page">
    <header>
      <p class="eyebrow">Foundation privacy notice</p>
      <h1>Privacy</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Last updated August 20, 2026. This notice describes the current static
        catalogue, not features planned for later releases.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section>
      <h2>What this site does</h2>
      <p>
        {SITE.name} publishes browser game descriptions, control notes, and category
        links. No account, payment, upload, contact form, analytics service, advertising
        system, or embedded game player is active in this release.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Information we do not collect</h2>
      <p>
        The application does not request names, email addresses, passwords,
        payment information, precise location, prompts, or uploaded files. It
        does not set application cookies or use information for AI training.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Hosting records</h2>
      <p>
        A future hosting provider may process ordinary network information such
        as an IP address, request time, requested path, and browser details to
        deliver and secure the site. The production provider and retention
        details must be added here before launch.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Cookies and third parties</h2>
      <p>
        There are currently no application cookies, analytics cookies,
        advertising cookies, third-party game frames, or cross-site tracking
        scripts. This notice must be updated before any such service is enabled.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Your choices and contact</h2>
      <p>
        Because this release collects no form or account data, there is no
        profile to access or delete. The operator identity, privacy contact, and
        applicable regional details must be published before production launch.
      </p>
    </section>

    <aside class="notice-box">
      This foundation notice is not legal advice. It requires review and final
      operator details before the site is launched.
    </aside>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
